Package: rw
Title: Robins-Wang Variance Estimation for Multiply Imputed Data
Version: 0.0.0.9002
Authors@R: c(
    person("Lucy", "D'Agostino McGowan", email = "lucydagostino@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre")),
    person("Suyang", "Yu", role = "aut"),
    person("Mark", "Giganti", role = "ctb"),
    person("Brian", "Williamson", role = "ctb")
  )
Description: Computes Robins-Wang variance estimates for analyses of multiply
    imputed data after normal, logistic, or predictive mean matching
    chained-equation imputation. Analysis models may be linear or binomial
    generalized linear models.
